dad did or people before him?

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:56.370
It's almost like a generational curse?

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:05.810
- I don't know my grandpa too well

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:10.593
but he was another alcoholic
till the day he died.

00:12:17.158 --> 00:12:17.991
Yeah.

00:12:23.175 --> 00:12:25.210
And he actually lived quite a long time

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:26.810
for being an alcoholic (sniffs).

00:12:34.579 --> 00:12:36.633
He used to live in Mexico.

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:40.162
We will go over there.

00:12:40.162 --> 00:12:42.873
I maybe went over like what? Twice.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.420
And I don't know that they have different,

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:51.558
I don't know where, believes.

00:12:51.558 --> 00:12:53.420
I don't know what do you call it,

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:57.090
but I will remember situations where

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:01.753
we would be in his ranch or
whatever you wanna call it.

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:06.110
He will get a stick
off the tree, a branch,

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:07.120
and he'd be like, "Watch,

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:08.720
you see what I'm going to do
right now, you're gonna see."

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:10.710
And I'm like, "Whoa, I will be watching."

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:12.227
He'll get her a knife and start peeling

00:13:12.227 --> 00:13:16.273
the long leaves that will be sticking out.

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:19.310
And then all of a sudden
he starts whooping me

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:22.767
with it like, that's
what I'm supposed to see?

00:13:23.857 --> 00:13:25.207
I don't know, It was weird.

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:27.223
What a shame.

00:13:43.091 --> 00:13:46.440
- [Interviewer] Do you feel
sometimes like life is unfair?

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:47.930
- I feel sometimes like what?

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.730
- [Interviewer] That life is unfair.

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:53.143
- Yeah,

00:13:58.640 --> 00:13:59.703
but then again,

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:08.453
I don't know.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.110
It's what you make it really,

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:19.660
but it's kind of difficult at times

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:24.660
'cause it's easier said than done and.

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:40.573
- [Interviewer] Do you feel
like there was something

00:14:40.573 --> 00:14:42.050
