00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:43.750
that kind of set you on this path?

00:14:45.199 --> 00:14:48.853
Living like you do and being addicted?

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:55.460
- It's funny because I mean,

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:58.710
it's once upon a time I told myself it's,

00:15:02.413 --> 00:15:04.220
it's enough, I don't wanna feel,

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:08.110
