this and leave it alone.

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:10.170
I don't wanna feel this, or,

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:12.493
but there was no such thing.

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:18.503
Like everything just gets worse.

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:23.503
- [Interviewer] Have you
been clean from heroin?

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:27.769
- Oh yeah, when I used to go to prison.

00:15:27.769 --> 00:15:30.719
(indistinct) Sometimes not even
there, we use in there too.

00:15:37.664 --> 00:15:40.164
(Ruby sniffs)

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.220
- [Interviewer] Do you have friends?

00:15:53.511 --> 00:15:56.761
- Do I have friends?

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:05.090
Wow, my one good friend
is gone, my mother but,

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:18.300
I guess you could say I do have friends,

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:22.863
but they won't be (indistinct)
they don't use drugs or,

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:29.720
