know what they're doing,

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:34.720
but my sister-in-law, my brother's wife,

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:40.880
I can call her my friend.

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:44.243
- [Interviewer] What was
the best time of your life?

00:17:03.786 --> 00:17:08.119
- When I was with my daughter's father.

00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:16.560
- [Interviewer] Did he passed away?

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:17.560
- Yeah, he got shot.

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:22.020
That's who I was talking
about that I was in love with.

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:22.853
- [Interviewer] Yeah.

00:17:22.853 --> 00:17:24.043
- Yeah, he got killed.

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:31.997
Well, he got robbed, but to
rob him they had to kill him.

