00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:07.180
Give people the benefit of the doubt.

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:10.590
Not everybody's the same, but I mean,

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:12.460
some people do have good qualities

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:16.733
