00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:20.563
Not everybody's out to get you,

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:24.943
but then again, like,
I don't know (laughs).

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:33.433
I don't know, maybe,

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:38.253
I don't know fuck.

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:44.180
