00:20:02.171 --> 00:20:06.004
- At times (sniffs).

00:20:18.149 --> 00:20:18.982
At times.

00:20:27.355 --> 00:20:32.355
At times, yeah (sniffs).

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:33.793
- [Interviewer] All right Ruby,

00:20:33.793 --> 00:20:35.377
